CHIP MATRIX MACH435
PIN 3 A
PIN 4 B
PIN 5 C
PIN 6 D
PIN 7 E
PIN 12 F
PIN 20 CLK
PIN 8 Q0 REG
PIN 9 Q1 REG
PIN 10 Q2 REG
PIN 19 Q3 
EQUATIONS
Q0=A*C*D+/A*B*/C*/D+A*D*/E*/F+/B*/C*D*E+/B*/C*/F+E*/F+/A*B*D*F
Q0.CLKF=CLK
Q1.T=A*D*E+/A*B*C*D+/A*C*/D+A*D*/E+A*C*D+/B*/C*/E+C*/E
Q1.CLKF=CLK
Q2=(D*/E*/F+/A*/D*/E*F+B*C*D+/B*/C*/D+/B*C*D*/F+A*D*E+/B*C*/E*F) :+: F
Q2.CLKF=CLK
Q3=/A*B*D*F+/A*/B*/D*E+A*B*C*/F+/C*E*/F+B*D*/E+B*D*E*/F+A*E
